  "schema:name": "P1 · The health check and the choice to share",
  "schema:description": "Three months before Hajj, Kamal has the mandatory pre-Hajj health examination with Dr Aisyah. He is fit to travel. She explains what the Hajj Health Record is, who can see it, and for how long. Kamal agrees on his wallet to share his patient summary with Saudi health workers during Hajj, and sets how the link to it is protected. Step 1 of the overview of key process flows.",
